    [Doc] kv-pool format update (#17473)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    This PR updates the KV Cache Pool (Ascend Store) documentation
    (`kv_pool.md`) to improve its structure and readability:
    - Moves the "Constraints and Limitations" section to follow "Usage
    Scenarios" for a more logical flow.
    - Adds detailed "Feature Verification" and "Feature Tuning" sections for
    Mooncake, Memcache, and Yuanrong backends to help users verify and
    optimize their deployments.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No, this is a documentation-only update.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    Documentation changes only, verified by rendering/previewing the
    markdown files.
    
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/ced6857afa0ea7b2e3f0846a62e1394e90f15607
    
    Signed-off-by: herizhen <1270637059@qq.com>

